<div class="WordSection1"><br clear="none" />
Thank you for contacting Qantas Freight.<br />
<br />
We can help with any cargo queries, but as your email relates to passenger booking / excess baggage, you'll need to contact the Qantas passenger reservations team.<br clear="none" />
<br clear="none" />
If you need immediate help, we suggest you contact the Qantas Customer Care team in Australia any time on 13 13 13. Overseas contact numbers can be found on <a href="http://www.qantas.com/travel/airlines/contacts/global/en?int_cam=au:qf:contactsmenu:0114" shape="rect" target="_blank">qantas.com</a>&nbsp;and the <a href="https://qantas.custhelp.com/app/answers/list" shape="rect" target="_blank">FAQ section</a>&nbsp;is also worth a visit.<br clear="none" />
&nbsp;&nbsp;
<div class="WordSection1">
<p>Kind Regards,<br />
